# 基础词 Unit 07 短语

## 常考短语

- **beyond doubt**: 毫无疑问 — His guilt was proven beyond doubt. 他的罪行毫无疑问地被证实了。
- **a matter of debate**: 有争议的事 — The issue is a matter of debate. 这个问题是有争议的。
- **in the past decade**: 在过去十年 — Technology has advanced greatly in the past decade. 技术在过去十年取得了巨大进步。
- **deceive sb. into doing**: 骗某人做 — He was deceived into signing. 他被骗签了字。
- **decline to do**: 拒绝做 — She declined to comment. 她拒绝评论。
- **on the decline**: 在衰退中 — Traditional industries are on the decline. 传统工业在衰退中。
- **dedicate oneself to**: 致力于 — He dedicated himself to science. 他致力于科学。
- **defend sb. from**: 保护某人免受 — The army defended the city from attack. 军队保卫城市免受攻击。
- **be defined as**: 被定义为 — Intelligence is defined as the ability to learn. 智力被定义为学习能力。
- **deliberate on**: 审议 — The board deliberated on the issue. 董事会审议了这个问题。
- **cure sb. of**: 治愈某人的 — The treatment cured him of his illness. 治疗治愈了他的疾病。
- **out of curiosity**: 出于好奇 — Out of curiosity, she opened the box. 出于好奇，她打开了盒子。
- **current affairs**: 时事 — She reads about current affairs. 她阅读时事。
- **do damage to**: 对…造成损害 — The flood did damage to crops. 洪水对庄稼造成了损害。
- **debate on/about**: 就…辩论 — They debated on the topic. 他们就话题辩论了。
- **decay of**: …的衰退 — The decay of the old building was evident. 旧建筑的衰败很明显。
- **decorate with**: 用…装饰 — The hall was decorated with lights. 大厅用灯装饰。
- **decrease in**: 在…方面减少 — There was a decrease in sales. 销售有所减少。
- **a critical point**: 关键时刻 — We reached a critical point. 我们到了关键时刻。
- **crucial to**: 对…至关重要 — Teamwork is crucial to success. 团队合作对成功至关重要。

